  "create_rusty_copper.ponder.copper_shaft_maintenance.header": "銅軸刮鏽施蠟",
  "create_rusty_copper.ponder.copper_shaft_maintenance.text_1": "執斧右按，一次可刮鏽一等。",
  "create_rusty_copper.ponder.copper_shaft_maintenance.text_2": "以蜜脾蠟引銅件，留其今貌，止其續鏽。",
  "create_rusty_copper.ponder.copper_shaft_maintenance.text_3": "蠟引留既有之鏽，亦留其功耗。",
