  "create_rusty_copper.ponder.copper_shaft_weathering.text_1": "未蠟引之銅機軸，隨時生鏽，凡歷四等。",
  "create_rusty_copper.ponder.copper_shaft_weathering.text_2": "依預設，鏽愈深，所耗功力愈多。",
  "create_rusty_copper.ponder.copper_shaft_weathering.text_3": "風蝕之軸，或使相連功脈盡竭而停。",
  "create_rusty_copper.ponder.copper_shaft_weathering.text_4": "其效視伺服器所設之鏽罰，及功脈承載而定。",
